# New selective GGUF acquisitions for llama.cpp
#
# Schema:
# alias|label|repo|revision|subdir|size_GB|group|status|include_patterns|runtime
#
# include_patterns is semicolon-separated. Each selective quant has a distinct
# subdirectory because repository, revision, and included payload form a separate
# acquisition identity.
#
# Reconcile exact filenames with `hf download --dry-run` before downloading.
# Replace revision=main with a pinned commit after read-only HF resolution.
# Sizes are planning estimates until measured by `hf download --dry-run`.
# Always configure an explicit bounded server context for these large models.

